            "type": "text",
            "text": "About this pattern"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A red boat made from an oval hull, a slim cylinder mast, and a flat oval sail. The hull uses a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "colour-change"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "colour change"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to add a white waterline stripe. The sail is worked flat and attached to the mast before the mast is sewn into the hull."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hull"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rounds: 18. Begin with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " at one end and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "amigurumi-increase"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "increase"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to the widest point. Work the waterline stripe in white using a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "colour-change"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "colour change"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", then "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "amigurumi-decrease"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "decrease"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to close the far end. Stuff firmly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
